  "audit_question": "Why v_2(N) := max{k : 2^k | N} and not log_2 N mod d, sin(2 pi log_2 N / d), N^(-1/3), N^(-2/3), N mod d, omega(N) prime-factor count, or no resonance term at all? Each candidate channel gets one extra coefficient added to the Q top-5% harmonic closure; we report chi^2, AICc, BIC, LOO chi^2 and rational-coefficient match.",
